    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list - two pointers</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/intersection-of-two-linked-lists/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 160</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Intersection of Two Linked Lists</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two lists that merge form a Y. Walk A then B with one pointer and B then A with the other: both cover a + c + b nodes, so they land on the join at the same moment, or on null together if there is no join. No lengths, no hash set. O(m + n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
